    "text_body": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Two days ago a contributor dropped a hosted memory backend straight into Aeon's tree; it was closed unmerged. Today the same skill returned as a one-line registry entry — code staying in the author's own repo — emblematic of the registry more than doubling in a day with zero new skill code entering the repo. The install protocol turned \"replace the root\" into a phone-book pointer, gated by an install-time scanner."
